{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And [YHWH] spoke.</b> He took a terse route, for Moses stands for all Israel. And Yefet said that the commandment is upon Moses to sanctify them verbally — the opposite of \"and the priest shall pronounce him impure\" (Leviticus 13:5), for the priest is holy and does not render him impure except by speech, saying with the mouth that he is impure."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:01.260684213Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}